#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:1
msgid "总结与展望"
msgstr "Summary and Outlook"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:3
msgid "本章核心回顾"
msgstr "Core Chapter Review"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:5
msgid "本章我们建立了深度学习的数学基础，形成了完整的训练流程："
msgstr "In this chapter, we established the mathematical foundations of deep learning and built a complete training workflow:"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:7
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**{ref}`computational-graph`：描述\"数据如何流动\"**"
msgstr "**{ref}`computational-graph`: Describes \"how data flows\"**"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:9
msgid "**直觉**：像工厂流水线，数据从输入到输出的处理流程"
msgstr "**Intuition**: Like a factory assembly line, tracing processing steps from input to output."

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:10
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**作用**：让复杂计算可视化，为{ref}`back-propagation`提供结构"
msgstr "**Role**: Visualizes complex computations and provides structure for {ref}`back-propagation`."

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:12
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**{ref}`task-formulations`：定义\"找什么规律\"**"
msgstr "**{ref}`task-formulations`: Defines \"what patterns to look for\"**"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:14
msgid "**直觉**：分类找边界、回归找映射、自回归找序列依赖"
msgstr "**Intuition**: Classification finds decision boundaries, regression finds mappings, and autoregression finds sequence dependencies."

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:15
msgid "**作用**：不同任务类型对应不同的输出形式和损失函数"
msgstr "**Role**: Different task types correspond to different output formats and loss functions."

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:17
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**{ref}`activation-functions`：引入非线性表达能力**"
msgstr "**{ref}`activation-functions`: Introduces non-linear expressiveness**"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:19
msgid "**直觉**：在特征空间中划分决策边界，将线性不可分数据\"折叠\"成可分"
msgstr "**Intuition**: Draws decision boundaries in feature space, \"folding\" linearly inseparable data into separable regions."

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:20
msgid "**关键**：ReLU是隐藏层默认选择，解决梯度消失问题"
msgstr "**Key**: ReLU is the default choice for hidden layers, mitigating the vanishing gradient problem."

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:22
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**{ref}`loss-functions`：定义\"什么是好的预测\"**"
msgstr "**{ref}`loss-functions`: Defines \"what makes a good prediction\"**"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:24
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**直觉**：衡量预测与真实的差距，塑造{ref}`gradient-descent`的优化地形"
msgstr "**Intuition**: Measures the gap between predictions and targets, shaping the optimization landscape for {ref}`gradient-descent`."

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:25
msgid "**关键**：交叉熵为分类提供强梯度，MSE适合回归"
msgstr "**Key**: Cross-entropy provides strong gradients for classification, while MSE suits regression."

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:27
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**{ref}`back-propagation`：\"信用分配\"机制**"
msgstr "**{ref}`back-propagation`: \"Credit assignment\" mechanism**"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:29
msgid "**直觉**：项目失败后倒推责任，按贡献度分配"
msgstr "**Intuition**: Tracing back responsibility after a project failure, assigning blame proportionally to contributions."

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:30
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**核心**：链式法则让梯度在{ref}`computational-graph`中高效回传"
msgstr "**Core**: The chain rule propagates gradients efficiently back through the {ref}`computational-graph`."

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:32
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**{ref}`gradient-descent`：在Loss Landscape中下山**"
msgstr "**{ref}`gradient-descent`: Walking downhill in the loss landscape**"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:34
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**直觉**：沿着{ref}`back-propagation`计算的最陡方向一步步接近山谷底部"
msgstr "**Intuition**: Step by step toward the valley floor along the steepest direction computed by {ref}`back-propagation`."

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:35
msgid "**要点**：学习率是关键，Adam是默认首选"
msgstr "**Key Point**: The learning rate is crucial; Adam is the default go-to."

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:37
msgid "训练流程全景"
msgstr "Training Workflow Overview"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:39
msgid "本章各节内容的关联："
msgstr "Interconnections among sections in this chapter:"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:52
msgid "**这就是深度学习训练的核心循环**："
msgstr "**This is the core deep learning training loop**:"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:54
msgid "数据流入计算图，根据任务类型（分类/回归/自回归）得到预测"
msgstr "Data flows into the computational graph to generate predictions based on the task type (classification/regression/autoregression)."

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:55
msgid "损失函数评估预测好坏"
msgstr "The loss function evaluates prediction quality."

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:56
msgid "反向传播计算每个参数的梯度"
msgstr "Backpropagation computes gradients for every parameter."

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:57
msgid "梯度下降调整参数，让损失减小"
msgstr "Gradient descent adjusts parameters to decrease the loss."

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:58
msgid "重复直到收敛"
msgstr "Repeat until convergence."

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:60
msgid "关键要点速查"
msgstr "Quick Reference of Key Points"

