msgstr "Step size"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:41
msgid "最关键超参，常用0.001-0.1"
msgstr "Most critical hyperparameter; commonly 0.001–0.1"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:72
msgid "常见问题速答"
msgstr "Frequently Asked Questions"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:74
msgid "**Q: 为什么需要激活函数？**   A: 没有激活函数，多层网络等价于单层线性变换，无法学习复杂模式。"
msgstr "**Q: Why are activation functions needed?**   A: Without activation functions, a multi-layer network is equivalent to a single linear transformation and cannot learn complex patterns."

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:77
msgid "**Q: 反向传播和梯度下降的关系？**   A: 反向传播**计算**梯度，梯度下降**使用**梯度更新参数。两者配合完成训练。"
msgstr "**Q: What is the relationship between backpropagation and gradient descent?**   A: Backpropagation **computes** gradients, while gradient descent **uses** gradients to update parameters. Together they complete training."

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:80
msgid "**Q: 损失函数和优化算法的关系？**   A: 损失函数定义\"去哪里\"（目标），优化算法决定\"怎么去\"（路径）。"
msgstr "**Q: What is the relationship between loss functions and optimization algorithms?**   A: The loss function defines \"where to go\" (the goal), while the optimization algorithm determines \"how to get there\" (the path)."

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:83
msgid "**Q: 局部最优真的是大问题吗？**   A: 在高维深度网络中，鞍点比局部最优更常见。随机梯度的噪声通常能帮助逃离。"
msgstr "**Q: Are local minima really a big problem?**   A: In high-dimensional deep networks, saddle points are much more common than local minima. Noise from stochastic gradients usually helps escape them."

