msgid "**卷积神经网络**：处理图像的空间特征"
msgstr "**Convolutional Neural Networks**: Processing spatial features of images"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:92
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**循环神经网络**：处理序列的时间特征（详见 {ref}`sequence-modeling`）"
msgstr "**Recurrent Neural Networks**: Processing temporal features of sequences (see {ref}`sequence-modeling` for details)"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:93
msgid "**训练技巧**：批归一化、Dropout、早停等"
msgstr "**Training Techniques**: Batch normalization, Dropout, early stopping, etc."

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:95
msgid "准备好了吗？"
msgstr "Are you ready?"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:98
msgid "现在你已经理解了深度学习\"为什么能工作\"。下一章我们将学习\"如何让它工作得更好\"——从理论走向实践，搭建和训练真实的神经网络。"
msgstr "Now you understand \"why deep learning works\". In the next chapter, we will learn \"how to make it work better\"—moving from theory to practice to build and train real neural networks."

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/the-end.md:100
msgid "记住：**数学只是工具，直觉才是向导，实践是检验真理的唯一标准。**"
msgstr "Remember: **Math is merely a tool, intuition is your guide, and practice is the sole criterion for testing truth.**"

